        "decision": "This source and its imported binding roles are byte-identical. Only the enumerated fixture/build producer inputs changed. The exact twelve producer edits are authenticated against the immutable baseline and own-line packed source; the complete106case roster and contract predicate files retain their original identities. Real isolated strict AOT and actual Angular harness execution now pass every original case independently on both lines. The prior complete source judgment and its evidence scopes remain preserved; producer identity is refreshed only for the finite reviewed deltas. This closes source/producer requalification only; full coordinator, native/browser/SSR and minimum-version matrices, independent audit and G11 remain mandatory.",
        "prior_decision": "The MatError import is explicitly type-only and is used as the public InjectionToken type parameter for its corresponding owned legacy token. This preserves the historical public peer type parameter while the emitted runtime token object remains independently owned and distinct from the modern peer. The class itself is a stable nondeprecated export on each exact minimum;its constructor and private members are never called by this route. Actual source typing and four-object Injector identity tests support the finite boundary.",
